          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194102_471884_29113"/>
          <body> if specified, defines the relative position of the Item representing the part with respect to the local coordinate system of the Item representing the tool. The value of this attribute need not be specified. </body>
        </ownedComment>
