          <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the ProcessOperationOccurrenceRelationship. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
