      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193934_554202_28341" xmi:uuid="f13a1175-2fcf-4abf-bf44-c750b649512c" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455123313385_821707_42300" xmi:uuid="ec08e3b8-52c1-4f3c-a7a4-abbf10e266c1" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193934_554202_28341"/>
          <body> the meaning of the relationship. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'decomposition': the ProcessOperationOccurrenceRelationship defines a relationship where the related ProcessOperationOccurrence is one of the components of the relating ProcessOperationOccurrence; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'exclusiveness': the ProcessOperationOccurrenceRelationship defines a relationship where the relating and the related ProcessOperationOccurrence shall not have any overlap in time of execution; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'sequence': the ProcessOperationOccurrenceRelationship defines a relationship where the relating ProcessOperationOccurrence shall be completed before the related ProcessOperationOccurrence starts; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'simultaneity': the ProcessOperationOccurrenceRelationship defines a relationship where the relating and the related ProcessOperationOccurrence objects are considered as occurring during the same time period; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;note&gt; The criteria for 'simultaneity' and specifically the allowed delay between two ProcessOperationOccurrence objects declared simultaneous, are user-dependent. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; See attribute cycleTime for additional information. &lt;/note&gt; &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'substitution': the ProcessOperationOccurrenceRelationship defines a relationship where the related ProcessOperationOccurrence replaces of the relating ProcessOperationOccurrence.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>RelationType</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193042_855579_23449"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193498_243863_25464"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
