          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193934_431267_28342"/>
          <body> one object of ProcessOperationOccurrence that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
