          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193935_747395_28345"/>
          <body> the period of time that shall elapse, at least, between the completion of the relating ProcessOperationOccurrence and the start of the related ProcessOperationOccurrence. &lt;example&gt;The ProcessOperationOccurrence 'polishing' must not be started less than 2 hours after the ProcessOperationOccurrence 'painting' ended. &lt;/example&gt;The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
