          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193941_815763_28375"/>
          <body> the meaning of the relationship. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; 'alternative': the ProcessPlanRelationship defines a relationship where the Related ProcessPlan may be used alternatively to the Relating ProcessPlan; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'version association': the ProcessPlanRelationship defines a relationship where the Related ProcessPlan is a version of the Relating ProcessPlan. In this case, only the Related ProcessPlan shall specify a &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_ProcessPlan.htm#ProcessPlan.VersionId&lt;/path&gt; VersionId&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'version sequence': the ProcessPlanRelationship defines a relationship where the Relating ProcessPlan is the preceding version and the Related ProcessPlan is the following version. In this case, both ProcessPlan objects shall specify a &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_ProcessPlan.htm#ProcessPlan.VersionId&lt;/path&gt; VersionId&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
