      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193937_993123_28354" xmi:uuid="d81e00b4-d0dc-4d14-9a7d-ba81e266e1d0" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455123756210_83870_42311" xmi:uuid="fe7a9479-e4c6-4fb8-aed5-b18a1f68f4a1" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193937_993123_28354"/>
          <body> the GeometricRepresentationRelationshipWithPlacementTransformation between the local coordinate system of the ProcessOperationResourceAssignment and the reference coordinate system. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt; The reference coordinate system is either the coordinate system of the reference tool (if present) for the concerned ProcessOperationDefinition or (if no reference tool is present) the coordinate system of the ProcessOperationDefinition itself. In the case where the value of the attribute ReferenceTool is 'True', no transformation shall be defined.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
