          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193937_998196_28355"/>
          <body> the rationale behind the use of the resource for a specific ProcessOperationOccurrence. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
