          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193928_23293_28316"/>
          <body> the text or the set of texts that provide further information about the ProcessOperationInputOrOutput. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
