          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193929_153472_28318"/>
          <body>the meaning of the Element behaviour for the operation. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'input': the identified element plays the role of an input; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'output': the identified element plays the role of an output.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
