          <body> the set of ShapeElement objects that are affected by the ProcessOperationOccurrence. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt;The following additional data can be assigned to a ProcessOperationInputOrOutput: DateTimeString, Document, DocumentVersion, DocumentDefinition, File, Effectivity, InformationUsageRight, PropertyValue, ExternalPropertyDefinition, and PropertyDefinition.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
